KEY DIFFERENCES TABLE:
======================

Feature           │ AI              │ ML              │ DL
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Scope             │ Broadest        │ Medium          │ Narrow (specific)
Learning Approach │ Rule-based/ML   │ Data-based      │ Neural Networks
Data Required     │ Varies          │ Medium          │ Large amount
Processing Power  │ Low to High     │ Medium          │ Very High
Interpretability  │ High            │ Medium          │ Low (Black Box)
Time to Train     │ Quick           │ Medium          │ Slow
Feature Engineer  │ Manual          │ Manual          │ Automatic

